        "title": "About Us",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "Welcome to MedTech Marketplace — the e-commerce platform where MedTech treats Healthcare.   \n\nWe’re the unbiased site where hospitals, clinics, and buyers can navigate what matters: product specs, transparent pricing, quotes, delivery ETA’s and rep info — all in one central place. \n\nNo more time spent on hold with customer care. No more finding reps. Just transparent MedTech intel delivered with simplicity. \n\nMedTech Marketplace saves time wasted on products, so it can be given back to patients.",
