    "collapsible_content_kpWMJ3": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_9CJ9KN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. What is MedTech Marketplace?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>MedTech Marketplace is an online platform designed to help access MedTech directly companies. It provides easier procurement, transparent pricing, and the ability to connect with reps and suppliers quickly.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rpymcm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. Who can use MedTech Marketplace?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Is a central place for Healthcare providers and institutions (or even everyday Australians) to transact with MedTech industry. Browse products, generate quotes, and track orders, interact with MedTech suppliers and more.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_D4Jrgi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. How does pricing work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Pricing shown on MedTech Marketplace reflects your hospital group’s negotiated rates. After sign-in, you will see the specific pricing available to your institution.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_QzyteG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Can hospitals sell surplus or expiring stock?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Hospitals can list products they no longer need, are nearing expiry, or have already expired. MedTech Marketplace helps connect sellers with potential buyers, reducing wastage and supporting sustainability.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TQcT8p": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. How do I connect with my local rep?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The “Find My Rep” feature lets you instantly identify and contact your local product representative for support, training, or urgent requirements.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_t6bwqY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Is MedTech Marketplace secure?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. All transactions and data are handled securely with encrypted systems. Your procurement and patient data remain protected at all times.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_QMiRda": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7. How do suppliers list their products?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Suppliers can apply to list their products by contacting the MedTech Marketplace team at <a href=\"mailto:support@medtech-marketplace.com\" title=\"mailto:support@medtech-marketplace.com\">support@medtech-marketplace.com</a>. The platform focuses on challenger companies with innovative solutions that offer value to hospitals.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JPA7UQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "8. Does MedTech Marketplace integrate with hospital systems?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Orders, quotes, and tracking information can be exported to support your existing procurement processes. Custom integrations are available for larger hospital groups on request.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
